{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":33728,\"title\":\"Magical Pokaan\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The energetic werewolf Liru, the joyful witch-in-training Uma, the motherly android Aiko, and the seductive vampire Pachira—are princesses from the netherworld who have traveled to the human world in search of a new home.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l09DBGlfomCZzD5jyMkj0CaE1Jw.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tAj16goVV87MRe2Mx7bAVm8tjiN.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":13,\"year\":2006,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":12,\"createdBy\":[\"Kenichi Yatagai\"],\"networks\":[\"Chiba TV\",\"Teletama\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2006-06-20\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1252385,\"name\":\"Momoko Saito\",\"character\":\"Uma\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":144650,\"name\":\"Aya Hirano\",\"character\":\"Pachira\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AvbCkdSXoKgrQAyG08b4WdGKoX5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1252386,\"name\":\"Satomi Akesaka\",\"character\":\"Aiko\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lzNjOMm9jomHb7XlVsjJy53a4CC.jpg\"},{\"id\":1241562,\"name\":\"Hitomi Nabatame\",\"character\":\"Liru\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jidfw5qDgZjC4TPY3YunJQxlEmr.jpg\"},{\"id\":1252387,\"name\":\"Nomico\",\"character\":\"Keimie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1252387,\"name\":\"Nomico\",\"character\":\"Jun\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":221772,\"name\":\"Wataru Hatano\",\"character\":\"Tan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/i1meHlOXLP2ubJZkmyGJONrxikQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":125618,\"name\":\"Showko Tsuda\",\"character\":\"Dr. K-Ko\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aa43VZidp7EnZ6OeQMIMW6abQnB.jpg\"},{\"id\":553959,\"name\":\"Kisho Taniyama\",\"character\":\"Hongo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9lOnUF6C6xEhZ0FQmYNzNZhcUpd.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"H5WYOgiuIeM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Hidcg232xFc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pPiw4ZaAGlo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":281042,\"title\":\"Food for the Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3jI8ZHkteqxYEi4xTET3HMQb4zD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42352941176470593,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":94693,\"title\":\"Wandering Witch: The Journey of Elaina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gR0qwFa17c6xHnIauHrpgRJKiaH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4211764705882353,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":94631,\"title\":\"Diary of Our Days at the Breakwater\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/htP11RpdXdOjPRsXjjpFsPU24gf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41682242990654206,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":312266,\"title\":\"Hanaori-san Still Wants to Fight in the Next Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h2JZRLaFXWWhh61vAjqgHXeiZd8.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4166666666666667,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":60667,\"title\":\"Gundam Build Fighters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzvm78n4yOmeO2FdtD2aAbjDTuG.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41600000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":94649,\"title\":\"Infinite Dendrogram\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ePUz7Zq1SRLhNWvaeQYm2oPj5H7.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41445783132530123,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":281044,\"title\":\"Solo Camping for Two\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/r1UVwYCQ4q02T40bdnRgTFLkOXc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4134328358208955,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":312522,\"title\":\"My Ribdiculous Reincarnation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cMWbu2oD199St13sQEIxBMGzPHV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41304347826086957,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":60672,\"title\":\"Recently, My Sister is Unusual\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rkoE7RxkBXuTfGUA6HwQ1DQftDc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4052631578947369,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":211522,\"title\":\"Niji-iro Prism Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2geyiLUvykkcquMPcyn594OfI2o.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":211531,\"title\":\"磯部磯兵衛物語\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/86cb8VQVPBcDNDP5siv2zG1O7kH.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":128118,\"title\":\"Deep Insanity: The Lost Child\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/msYpjVD5wLRfZDdBTbnSej4tvTC.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2233766233766234,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9A4J9xIupDqgF7leYexRDsX6Jkz.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2006-04-04\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The First Spell is an Easy Trap/The Afternoon Spell is a Red Cap\",\"overview\":\"A. Super Doctor K-Ko and Hongo have devised traps that end up trapping Pachira, Liru, and Aiko. Thus, Uma ends up coming to the rescue.\\n\\nB. Upon learning about mail, Uma tries to build a mailbox with Aiko's help so that the girls can receive mail. Then the next part involves trying to get the mailman on their route to give them mail.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162349/original.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-04\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Spell of the Moon is a Blood Pedigree/The Make-Believe Spell is TV Shopping\",\"overview\":\"A. Following an incident at the prehistoric mammal section of the museum, Liru discovers love when she meets a man named Ryo who turns out to be another werewolf.\\n\\nB. While watching TV, Uma and Pachira learn about home shopping when they see an Electric Trainer (a type of fitness belt) on TV. When Uma orders for the Electric Trainer, the other girls get interested in TV shopping until they learn that home shopping includes having to pay for the stuff.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162370/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-11\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Tomorrow's Spell Is Donation for Love/The Spell of Happiness Is an Ideal Man\",\"overview\":\"A. When encountering a cute guy outside of a Blood Donation Bus, Pachira ends up donating some of her blood and ends up weak. This ends up tempting her to try to suck blood from Uma and Liru.\\n\\nB. While in a movie theater, the girls discuss their dream boyfriend. When Aiko's weight ends up disabling an elevator, the girls talk about how they would meet their dream boyfriend while stripping into their underclothes when the elevator gets warmer.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162382/original.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-18\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Secret Spell Is the Beginning of the Rainy Season/The Spell of Relativity Is Tanabata, The Star Festival\",\"overview\":\"A. During the rainy season, Aiko's systems are covered in mildew making her voice sound bad. While Liru is playing in the rain, Uma and Pachira try to clean Aiko's systems upon deactivating her.\\n\\nB. A heat wave has struck Hikarigaoka and the girls learn that Tanabata occurs on the 7th of July while deciding what wish should be granted by it.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162398/original.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-04-25\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"A Tiring Spell Is a Trip to the Beach/Love's Spell Is a Trip to the Beach\",\"overview\":\"A. When a typhoon ruins their day at the beach, the girls try to improvise at the nearest hotel.\\n\\nB. Following an accident with their floats, the girls are saved from drowning by Lulu, a mermaid who is the princess of the merfolk. They soon help her in obtaining a boy that she has a crush on, who Yuma ends up take. Lulu finds a mate in a jellyfish and, at the end of the episode, Yuma and the other nether princess have a fight. The girls (excluding Yuma)go home, while Yuma and the boy go for a swim, the boy turns out to be a spirit leading Yuma to her doom.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162406/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-02\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Spell of Rebirth Is a Search Through Hell/A Healing Spell Is a Park Debut\",\"overview\":\"A. In a follow-up to the ending of the previous episode, Uma has died and is condemned to Hell by Enma (played by Super Doctor K-Ko). In each level of Hell, Uma encounters hellish and demonic counterparts of her fellow princesses where she ends up driving them crazy.\\n\\nB. With help from Jun, Tan, and Liru's werewolf form, Uma performs magic tricks in the park to entertain the people there and show off her magic.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162416/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-09\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"A Rich-Flavored Spell Is the Night of the Full Moon/A Combining Spell Is the Invincible Robot, M5\",\"overview\":\"A. Liru prepares for the viewing of the Full Moon by obtaining the supplies to it and finding a perfect spot in the park to view the Full Moon at.\\n\\nB. In this Super Robot-type segment, Uma, Pachira, Liru, and Keimie act out as Magical 5 to save their teammate Aiko and their fuel company from a giant Mecha-Hongo robot created by Super Doctor K-Ko.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162427/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-16\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Tonight's Spell Is a Vampire/The Spell of Dreams Is Magic That Lasts One Day\",\"overview\":\"A. People throughout Hikarigaoka are being attacked by a vampire at night. Jun, Tan, and Liru each suspect Pachira for the attacks upon seeing her silhouette attack someone. Pachira suspects that someone else is behind these attacks.\\n\\nB. Aiko wins Happy Chalk from a prize in Makai Teen Magazine which can bring anything that's drawn to life. Since it can only work for a witch, Uma uses it to draw various things including drawing up a galactic train to take them to the Andromeda Galaxy in one of Aiko's attempts to gain a human body.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162436/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-23\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Spell of Breaching Is Inviting a Love Interest Home/The White Spell Is Christmas\",\"overview\":\"A. While out getting Ishiyakiimo (yams baked on hot stones), Liru ends up saving a guy from being beaten up. She then ends up seeing a fallen CD with its shape turning her into her werewolf form. When Aiko invites him to their house, Liru doesn't want to be seen in her current form and Pachira wants him to herself.\\n\\nB. After reading a Christmas story, the girls prepare for Christmas ranging from Aiko making a metal stocking, the girls preparing a Christmas feast, the girls solving their chimney problem, and the girls preparing for the arrival of Santa Claus.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162446/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-05-30\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Cold Spell Is a Snowboard Ski/The Hot Spell Is a Spontaneous Onsen\",\"overview\":\"A. The girls hit the slopes and learn how to ski. When they fail to make a reservation at one of the lodges, they end up staying with some snow people who attempt to add them to their frozen collection.\\n\\nB. While walking through the woods, the girls find a hot spring that Liru told them about and end up encountering women who turn out to be Tanukis that end up stealing their clothes.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162453/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-06\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Spell of Reticence Is Having Fun with English Conversation/The Crisis Spell Is the Other Side of Goodbye\",\"overview\":\"A. The girls play a \\\"speaking English\\\" game hosted by Keimie and a mess-up has them drinking the bad-tasting Natto drink.\\n\\nB. The girls see Super Doctor K-Ko on a TV show revolving on the theory of horror movie monsters existing amongst the human race. When the co-host of the TV show ends up discovering the girl's secret thanks to footage used by Super Doctor K-Ko, it is then made public. The girls experience fame up to the point where they end up on a discussion show against Super Doctor K-Ko in the discussion if monsters from the Netherworld are dangerous.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162466/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-13\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Spell of Grief Is When Memories Change/The Gentle Spell Is a Magician\",\"overview\":\"A. Aiko finds a VCR that contains her memories as a rerun of the girls' favorite show is airing. When the girls plan to use the VCR to tape it, they end up needing D/A Converter to hook it up to their Digital Television and search the entire country for one.\\n\\nB. When Uma ends up with a cold, she ends up getting the other girls infected with her magic when they make fun of her. With her magic perfected, she practices it on the town. After curing herself and the other girls of the cold, they soon work on a way to make a Cherry Blossom Tree in front of a hospital bloom early when Uma runs out of magic.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/162480/original.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2006-06-20\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2006-04-04\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}